Viktor 14.10.2026: «Разметку секций в плеере над волной — отдельным шрифтом… Отдельный шрифт для всех текстовых кнопок… ± масштаб относительно основного шрифта: 2pt по 1pt шага». Section marks: the sections' names drawn on the wave and on its scope (IBM Plex Mono by default, as they were). Buttons: every button with words, the toggles, the menus' items (the text's by default; a font picked dresses them). Headings, Rooms, Section marks and Buttons each a − and a + beside its font, −2…+2 pt by 1, on top of the page's own text size; a lifted frame's step kept.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
